diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index cb5fe71..6ead8e8 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,12 @@
 
 All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. See [standard-version](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/standard-version) for commit guidelines.
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### 🚨 Breaking changes
+
+- Error responses from `HTTPError` now use [RFC 9457](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9457.html) problem details with `Content-Type: application/problem+json`. The body has `type`, `title`, `status`, `detail` and `instance`; `message`, `statusText` and `unhandled` are no longer sent. `body` members can no longer override the RFC members, and `HTTPError.toJSON()` returns the problem details body.
+
 ## v2.0.8
 
 [compare changes](https://github.com/h3js/h3/compare/v2.0.7...v2.0.8)
